  "copyright_text": "PEANUTS and all related titles, logos and characters are trademarks of Peanuts Worldwide LLC © 2025 Peanuts Worldwide LLC. Copyright 2025 GameMill Entertainment. All rights reserved. All trademarks are the property of their respective owners. Published and Distributed by 3goo K.K. in Japan and Asia.",
